00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:20.570
Really? Well, okay. I knew. We call this mysterious creature an angel.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:29.220
The fourth angel. Amazing.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:43.500
The speed of regeneration is almost perfect, the self-sufficient form of life, because the angels have tasted the fruit of life, and they are called to destroy us, who have tasted the fruit of wisdom.

