the driver went to heaven

00:56:31.880 --> 00:56:38.680
I got you. The 508th planned synchro test program is completed. Cindy, we're done.

00:56:39.280 --> 00:56:42.550
And how do you live with him?

00:56:43.290 --> 00:56:44.900
I got a little used to it.

00:56:45.060 --> 00:56:49.800
Just a little? It's like you're living with a man for the first time.

00:56:50.130 --> 00:56:53.080
It's not like it was eight years ago.

00:56:53.260 --> 00:56:55.220
This time it's not love.

00:56:55.820 --> 00:56:56.960
Of course, of course.

00:56:57.440 --> 00:56:59.480
Or maybe Cindy is jealous of you?

00:57:00.760 --> 00:57:00.980
No.

00:57:01.220 --> 00:57:01.380
Huh?

00:57:02.690 --> 00:57:04.730
Probably, he stayed because of his father.

00:57:05.630 --> 00:57:08.380
He wants his father to notice him.

00:57:08.380 --> 00:57:10.290
To appreciate him, to praise him.

00:57:10.290 --> 00:57:11.090
At least once.

00:57:11.190 --> 00:57:12.530
At least with one word.

00:57:12.750 --> 00:57:13.880
He wants warmth.

00:57:14.060 --> 00:57:16.710
To have something to squeeze out the loneliness.

00:57:17.640 --> 00:57:19.470
What a bad father.

00:57:19.870 --> 00:57:21.630
Just like you.

00:57:21.990 --> 00:57:27.420
Why is Commander Ikori so uninterested in his own son?

00:57:27.800 --> 00:57:29.870
He normally communicates with...

00:57:30.030 --> 00:57:31.550
Ray, what a disbalance!

00:57:31.850 --> 00:57:35.860
It seems that nowadays all men are interested only in themselves.

00:57:36.160 --> 00:57:38.200
Hard times for women.

00:57:41.600 --> 00:57:44.320
Okay, it's time, I need to go back.

00:57:45.360 --> 00:57:48.200
As always, you are at work.

00:57:48.440 --> 00:57:54.620
Isata, if you go home, here is an official pass for Cindy and a new one for Ray Ayanami.

00:57:54.760 --> 00:57:56.250
I forgot to give it to them.

00:57:57.660 --> 00:57:59.020
Will you ask Cindy to give it to you?

00:58:02.080 --> 00:58:02.880
Well, okay.

00:58:03.200 --> 00:58:17.400
Ayan is afraid of me.

00:58:53.250 --> 00:58:57.870
It's Igor, and I'm Nami. I'm coming in.

00:59:36.490 --> 00:59:36.610
Thank you.

01:00:30.190 --> 01:00:31.150
Maybe you'll clean it up?

01:00:33.600 --> 01:00:58.380
I... I just... I... I...

01:00:59.310 --> 01:00:59.630
I... I...

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:15.120
I was asked to give you a new pass, so I...

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.980
That I forgot to give it back. It's true.

01:01:32.220 --> 01:01:34.750
I called, but no one answered.

01:01:35.010 --> 01:01:36.900
The door was open...

01:01:37.120 --> 01:01:39.820
Oh, shit!

01:01:59.180 --> 01:01:59.480
This...

01:02:00.220 --> 01:02:03.100
This is your new pass. Ritska just asked me for it.

01:02:19.760 --> 01:02:24.540
Aren't you scared? Are you scared to climb down again?

01:02:24.560 --> 01:02:29.970
I heard that you are very...

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:35.180
I've been hurt for the last time, so I wanted to ask you if you're not scared.

01:02:35.720 --> 01:02:37.290
No, I'm not scared.

01:02:39.330 --> 01:02:41.860
What if he stops listening again?

01:02:41.980 --> 01:02:47.960
If the angels hold us up, maybe they'll kill us all?

01:02:47.980 --> 01:02:50.940
What are you doing?

01:02:56.340 --> 01:02:57.000
Of course not!

01:02:57.120 --> 01:02:58.520
To believe such a father!

01:03:01.240 --> 01:03:03.010
What are you doing?

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:32.560
The signature is blue, it's an angel!

01:03:32.640 --> 01:03:34.760
So this is the sixth angel, right?

01:03:35.080 --> 01:03:38.470
Obviously, the fight will go to the first number.

01:03:38.730 --> 01:03:42.060
Eva number one, get ready for...

01:03:43.720 --> 01:03:48.600
The target passes over Lake Asinoko.

01:03:48.720 --> 01:03:50.300
Number one, the launch is ready.

01:03:51.000 --> 01:03:51.560
Launching!

01:04:01.950 --> 01:04:02.610
ENERGETICS!

01:04:02.610 --> 01:04:03.690
What did you say?!

01:04:03.690 --> 01:04:04.230
It can't be!

01:04:04.810 --> 01:04:05.170
RUN!

01:04:08.510 --> 01:04:08.570
Huh?

01:04:09.090 --> 01:04:28.440
Not for my father!

01:04:28.580 --> 01:04:29.900
For the shield!

01:04:30.120 --> 01:04:30.840
Go to hell!

01:05:00.280 --> 01:05:00.580
I can't believe it!

01:05:01.390 --> 01:05:17.190
Emergency fire capsule!

01:05:17.530 --> 01:05:18.490
I forbid it.

01:05:19.050 --> 01:05:22.880
If the pilot is not in Evia, she will disappear from Epoil.

01:05:23.480 --> 01:05:24.840
And then everything will get worse.

01:05:25.500 --> 01:05:26.800
Unimaginably worse than now.

01:05:27.200 --> 01:05:28.860
It's okay.

01:05:40.110 --> 01:05:41.690
Overdrive of operating nodes!

01:06:04.640 --> 01:06:09.640
Saving squad, get ready!

01:06:09.780 --> 01:06:11.700
Priority of cooling LCL inside the capsule!

01:06:11.700 --> 01:06:13.040
Pilot is alive, pulse is weak!

01:06:13.240 --> 01:06:15.000
Forced life support mode!

01:06:15.100 --> 01:06:16.000
Massage the heart!

01:06:16.600 --> 01:06:16.700
Go!

01:06:18.860 --> 01:06:19.950
Pulse appeared!

01:06:20.760 --> 01:06:22.390
Emergency shot of the capsule!

01:06:22.730 --> 01:06:27.550
Emergency drop of LCL!

01:06:27.870 --> 01:06:28.090
Yes!

01:06:28.590 --> 01:06:29.230
Yes!

01:06:31.080 --> 01:06:32.000
Give me therapy!

01:07:11.000 --> 01:07:13.600
At the moment, the target is directly above us.

01:07:13.920 --> 01:07:16.140
Burying the surface, breaking through the geofront.

01:07:16.280 --> 01:07:18.780
So he wants to attack the NERV headquarters directly.

01:07:19.480 --> 01:07:22.610
I would like to hear a report from each of the departments.

01:07:22.990 --> 01:07:29.540
Based on the latest data, it can be concluded that the target destroys any object within a certain radius.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:32.260
This means that the close combat is automatically lost.

01:07:33.200 --> 01:07:34.500
What about the AT field?

01:07:34.740 --> 01:07:37.630
It is active. Besides, its topology is constantly changing,

01:07:37.950 --> 01:07:40.280
which leads to the change in the shape of the object itself.

01:07:40.460 --> 01:07:41.560
It will be a difficult task to neutralize such a field.

01:07:42.680 --> 01:07:46.620
According to the magic calculation, if you try to penetrate the target's AT field

01:07:46.620 --> 01:07:48.640
with the help of a deep bomb N2,

01:07:48.960 --> 01:07:53.300
the minimum required charge will destroy the entire NERF headquarters.

01:07:53.300 --> 01:07:56.300
The second magician Matsusira came to the same conclusion.

01:07:56.300 --> 01:07:59.360
By the way, the government of Japan and the UN...

01:08:00.190 --> 01:08:02.470
To bomb the headquarters, Nerv is doing everything he can.

01:08:02.770 --> 01:08:05.450
These idiots don't care what happens to us.

01:08:05.930 --> 01:08:08.110
We'll lose the headquarters and it's over for everyone.

01:08:08.550 --> 01:08:11.430
The problem is that Astrayev has already passed the second layer,

01:08:11.530 --> 01:08:15.000
and now there will be a third. So the question is only in time.

01:08:15.300 --> 01:08:19.100
To reach the headquarters, he will need to break through all 22 layers.

01:08:19.240 --> 01:08:24.950
At the current pace, this will happen tomorrow at 0 o'clock 6 minutes 54 seconds.

01:08:25.230 --> 01:08:27.680
In general, there are 10 hours and 14 minutes left.

01:08:27.700 --> 01:08:29.980
Besides, the zero room is not yet set up, so...

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:30.780
You can't let them into battle.

01:08:31.360 --> 01:08:35.050
And the number one won't be able to work in full force because of the damage he has received.

01:08:35.960 --> 01:08:37.800
Yes, our business is so-so.

01:08:37.920 --> 01:08:40.590
We've just been laid off from all sides.

01:08:40.940 --> 01:08:42.880
Maybe we should raise the white flag?

01:08:43.520 --> 01:08:48.480
Well, maybe. But first I want to try something else.

01:08:48.600 --> 01:08:52.580
The intelligence department stores all the materials on the army developments.

01:09:07.770 --> 01:09:09.290
Director of Operation Katsuragi,

01:09:09.430 --> 01:09:12.890
would you like to offer us another one of your craziest plans?

01:09:13.490 --> 01:09:15.210
Craziest? How impolite of you.

01:09:15.310 --> 01:09:17.290
This plan is set to 9 o'clock,

01:09:17.410 --> 01:09:19.400
which gives the greatest chance to all.

01:09:19.900 --> 01:09:21.060
Operation Yesina.

01:09:21.360 --> 01:09:22.880
For this, it is necessary not only to collect electricity

01:09:22.880 --> 01:09:24.160
from all over Japan,

01:09:24.420 --> 01:09:28.300
but also to requisition a powerful self-propelled positron cannon,

01:09:28.580 --> 01:09:29.960
and an experimental sample...

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:34.130
And the research department of the strategic unit of the Self-Defense Forces.

01:09:34.190 --> 01:09:36.380
And as I understand, the cannon is not finished yet.

01:09:36.440 --> 01:09:38.290
And can not adjust to the goal itself.

01:09:38.510 --> 01:09:40.110
So without Eva it will not work here.

01:09:40.390 --> 01:09:41.250
Okay, UN army.

01:09:41.890 --> 01:09:45.310
But how did you manage to convince the Ministry of Internal Affairs?

01:09:45.490 --> 01:09:47.680
Not to mention the strategists and the Self-Defense Forces.

01:09:48.030 --> 01:09:50.750
Well, there was a debt for them.

01:09:50.810 --> 01:09:55.060
Oh, the fisherman sees from afar.

01:09:55.060 --> 01:09:59.840
Today at 0 o'clock in the night...

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:03.360
and the power is turned off by the whole country until early morning.

01:10:03.890 --> 01:10:07.410
Tonight, from 00 a.m. until early morning,

01:10:07.610 --> 01:10:10.870
the power is turned off by the whole country.

01:10:11.310 --> 01:10:13.270
We hope you understand.

01:10:13.770 --> 01:10:17.810
I repeat, tonight, from 00 a.m. until early morning,

01:10:18.010 --> 01:10:19.910
the power is turned off by the whole country...

01:10:50.990 --> 01:10:52.930
What about the energy delivery system?

01:10:53.050 --> 01:10:58.650
Power will go through the transformer station at the new Katemba and through two spare power stations.

01:11:00.700 --> 01:11:02.680
and is moving towards the mountain of Kutag.

01:11:02.860 --> 01:11:05.240
The transfer of all cables and installation of transformers

01:11:05.240 --> 01:11:08.580
will be finished today at 8.50 p.m.

01:11:08.580 --> 01:11:10.120
So, report on the sniper system.

01:11:10.540 --> 01:11:11.460
There are no problems with the assembly yet.

01:11:12.200 --> 01:11:13.360
They should be in time for the start of the operation.

01:11:14.580 --> 01:11:16.140
What about Eva No. 1?

01:11:16.300 --> 01:11:19.180
They are equipped with type G equipment for sniper shooting.

01:11:19.620 --> 01:11:21.880
The work will be finished in two hours.

01:11:21.880 --> 01:11:24.110
I got you. Now it's up to the pilot.

01:11:24.450 --> 01:11:28.210
So, will he sit in Eva again?

01:11:31.150 --> 01:11:33.230
What are you going to do with pilot number one?

01:11:34.920 --> 01:11:36.860
Imitation capsules are not ready for the tests yet.

01:11:37.460 --> 01:11:41.850
Until we can apply them in practice, the pilot will work.

01:11:41.850 --> 01:11:44.390
At least brainwashing?

01:11:44.550 --> 01:11:46.830
If he becomes useless, we'll take Ray.

01:11:47.010 --> 01:11:51.000
Put Ray in number one? Isn't it too dangerous?

01:11:51.540 --> 01:11:55.380
Until the victory of eight angels.

01:11:55.720 --> 01:11:58.280
At what price, the question of much less importance.

01:12:00.350 --> 01:12:01.790
And the rest will come later.

01:12:02.030 --> 01:12:15.940
I want to be accepted for what I can do.

01:12:16.020 --> 01:12:17.580
That's why no one praises me.

01:12:17.680 --> 01:12:19.460
And if I can't do it, they'll hate me.

01:12:19.560 --> 01:12:21.420
And if it's really bad, I'll die.

01:12:21.880 --> 01:12:24.160
What am I doing here?

01:12:24.680 --> 01:12:27.420
I thought something would change.

01:12:27.660 --> 01:12:29.130
I thought something would happen.

01:12:30.120 --> 01:12:33.310
That's why I came. Not to suffer.

01:12:34.070 --> 01:12:37.920
Are you going to run away from trouble all your life?

01:12:38.040 --> 01:12:47.260
What am I living for? I have no reason to live.

01:12:49.180 --> 01:12:51.700
I don't need anyone. Neither dad, nor Misato.

01:12:51.920 --> 01:12:58.520
I don't need anyone. If I don't pilot E.O., then I have to pilot it.

01:13:00.480 --> 01:13:01.720
That's why I'm staying here.

01:13:02.020 --> 01:13:04.980
But when am I in it?

01:13:05.220 --> 01:13:15.480
The same ceiling. When I pilot it, everything ends like this.

01:13:19.740 --> 01:13:24.070
Yanami, you were here all this time?

01:13:24.690 --> 01:13:29.980
I'm telling you. The plan for Operation Yassima, which began...

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:31.260
The operation will start at 00.00.

01:13:32.160 --> 01:13:37.990
Pilots Ikori and Ayanomi must be at the second terminal today at 19.30.

01:13:37.990 --> 01:13:43.030
At 20.00, having taken places in the first and zero numbers, the movement begins.

01:13:43.070 --> 01:13:45.120
At 20.05, the launch.

01:13:45.870 --> 01:13:49.190
At 20.30, arrival to the second fortified area of Mount Futaga.

01:13:49.660 --> 01:13:52.560
Pilots are in combat readiness to receive instructions.

01:13:52.900 --> 01:13:55.560
With the arrival of the next day, the operation begins.

01:13:57.480 --> 01:13:57.780
Food.

01:14:00.440 --> 01:14:02.000
I don't want to, I don't want to.

01:14:02.080 --> 01:14:03.960
You have 90 minutes left.

01:14:04.000 --> 01:14:06.790
Do I have to go through this again?

01:14:07.850 --> 01:14:08.170
Yes.

01:14:08.290 --> 01:14:12.000
I can't, I don't want to go through this nightmare anymore.

01:14:12.060 --> 01:14:15.790
It's scary, scary. I can't run away.

01:14:16.170 --> 01:14:21.430
Are you afraid of Eva? Then you can just sleep.

01:14:23.450 --> 01:14:24.700
Just sleep?

01:14:24.980 --> 01:14:25.500
I'll take number one.

01:14:31.310 --> 01:14:51.060
The 17th defense layer passed.

01:14:51.060 --> 01:14:54.450
The technical staff has reported a loss of 455 meters.

01:14:54.470 --> 01:14:57.450
I'm counting on the power cable through the tachograph.

01:14:57.810 --> 01:14:59.650
The results of the operation are immediate.

01:15:00.760 --> 01:15:04.100
At the moment, there are 16 V-transformers in operation.

01:15:04.100 --> 01:15:07.180
The start of the 500 kV-transformers is planned.

01:15:07.440 --> 01:15:08.840
No changes will be made.

01:15:08.840 --> 01:15:11.400
We will be at the airport every day for 5 minutes.

01:15:12.040 --> 01:15:15.000
We are responsible for the request to hurry up with the completion of the work.

01:15:15.160 --> 01:15:16.260
Start the fourth test.

01:15:16.460 --> 01:15:18.380
Check the support system once again.

01:15:19.000 --> 01:15:21.720
The status of the light conductors is complete.

01:15:22.040 --> 01:15:25.020
Start checking the work of the systems according to the instructions.

01:15:26.060 --> 01:15:29.500
Checking the shutdown and disconnection of the final light conductors.

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:33.360
The transfer of the transporters is completed, there are no losses.

01:15:33.760 --> 01:15:36.620
Hurry up, fix the post-tron cannon!

01:15:40.450 --> 01:15:44.070
There is an experienced sample of a large post-tron cannon.

01:15:44.510 --> 01:15:47.130
Of course, it was assembled in a hurry, but in theory everything should work.

01:15:47.510 --> 01:15:52.310
The exact adjustment will be made using equipment of the type G, which was forced to link with the cannon.

01:15:52.610 --> 01:15:53.710
We will count on it.

01:15:54.680 --> 01:15:57.060
Yes, because you don't have to count on the pilot.

01:15:57.340 --> 01:15:59.400
I hope everything will work out for the MSAT.

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:14.470
Cindy, it's been a long time since the meeting. You decided to stay here yourself.

01:16:14.490 --> 01:16:17.400
So do your job properly.

01:16:21.300 --> 01:16:29.980
Sit in a safe command center and give it back.

01:16:30.030 --> 01:16:32.280
But I'm the only one to suffer.

01:16:32.580 --> 01:16:34.370
Misato, it's not fair.

01:16:34.750 --> 01:16:44.540
Come with me.

01:16:45.620 --> 01:16:56.660
15 years ago, half of humanity was destroyed by the second blow.

01:16:56.940 --> 01:16:59.880
If the Angels succeed...

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:07.680
call the third blow this time it will be finished and with the second half I hear it a million times

01:17:07.680 --> 01:17:19.300
if we allow the angel to penetrate level 3 and the headquarters here everything will be blown up without a doubt and

01:17:19.360 --> 01:17:29.970
automatically to take the third blow we are ready to die together with the angel ready everyone everyone who is here

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:59.860
work without exception the beginning of my whole life on this planet

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:05.500
And at the same time, the key to her end is the second angel, Lilith.

01:18:06.510 --> 01:18:06.950
Lilith?

01:18:07.300 --> 01:18:11.160
Yes, she is also called the trigger of the third blow.

01:18:11.380 --> 01:18:14.070
And it is impossible to protect Lilith with the help of Eva.

01:18:15.010 --> 01:18:17.580
Without one person, without you.

01:18:17.760 --> 01:18:22.420
We entrust tomorrow, the day of all mankind, to Evangelion and to you.

01:18:22.580 --> 01:18:25.160
What do you mean?

01:18:27.220 --> 01:18:29.880
There is no reason. It's just that...

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:32.180
that you turned out to be this person.

01:18:32.180 --> 01:18:35.390
I just wanted to say that you are not alone,

01:18:35.510 --> 01:18:36.870
you are risking your life, fighting.

01:18:37.370 --> 01:18:40.010
We are all in the same boat.

01:19:02.010 --> 01:19:04.950
So, I'm explaining the area of responsibility of each person in this operation.

01:19:05.330 --> 01:19:05.810
Cindy.

01:19:06.270 --> 01:19:06.730
Yes.

01:19:07.180 --> 01:19:08.440
You will shoot in the first room.

01:19:09.140 --> 01:19:09.620
Yes.

01:19:09.850 --> 01:19:12.940
Ray, you will serve as a defense in the zero room.

01:19:12.980 --> 01:19:18.110
The point is that for this operation, extreme accuracy is necessary.

01:19:18.350 --> 01:19:21.210
Therefore, the first room has an advantage over the zero one,

01:19:21.210 --> 01:19:22.990
the setting of which has not yet been completed.

01:19:23.390 --> 01:19:24.630
Be careful, Cindy.

01:19:25.420 --> 01:19:27.660
Positrons will be affected by the rotation of the Earth,

01:19:27.800 --> 01:19:29.200
its magnetic field and gravity.

01:19:30.090 --> 01:19:34.270
They will not fly in a straight line, so do not forget to take into account all these factors when aiming.

01:19:34.790 --> 01:19:37.930
Break the core. Exactly in the only place.

01:19:38.290 --> 01:19:41.060
I don't even know where his core is.

01:19:41.240 --> 01:19:42.080
It's okay.

01:19:42.620 --> 01:19:46.680
Inside the target there is one part that materializes only at the moment of attack.

01:19:46.880 --> 01:19:49.260
We assume that this is the core.

01:19:49.440 --> 01:19:53.400
We will determine the point from which to shoot and enter all the necessary parameters.

01:19:53.800 --> 01:19:56.060
You just need to, as written in the instructions,

01:19:56.280 --> 01:19:59.700
click on the trigger when the crosshairs of the sight in the center converge.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:10.750
The next thing is automation. Just keep in mind that the point from where you will shoot and where the electricity is supplied is the only one.

01:20:10.810 --> 01:20:14.120
I can't talk about getting away from it.

01:20:14.380 --> 01:20:16.390
That is, you can't run away.

01:20:16.790 --> 01:20:21.000
Right. If I miss, the enemy will shoot.

01:20:21.920 --> 01:20:26.310
Now think only about one thing. About hitting the enemy from the first shot.

01:20:26.510 --> 01:20:29.150
So if I don't hit, it will be very bad.

01:20:30.800 --> 01:20:33.590
Am I supposed to protect number one?

01:20:33.790 --> 01:20:34.070
Yes!

01:20:34.890 --> 01:20:35.450
Okay.

01:20:37.010 --> 01:20:39.280
It's time. Go change your clothes.

01:20:39.600 --> 01:20:39.760
Yes.

01:20:49.700 --> 01:20:55.690
We might die.

01:20:56.050 --> 01:20:56.350
No.

01:21:00.440 --> 01:21:03.790
